13
00:00:28,151 --> 00:00:28,900
all.

14
00:00:29,350 --> 00:00:36,267
If you like finding the hidden money behind the headlines, hit subscribe and like. It really helps the channel.

15
00:00:47,517 --> 00:00:50,709
What exactly were investors buying?

16
00:00:56,517 --> 00:00:59,297
The idea came from Jeffrey Katzenberg,

17
00:00:59,297 --> 00:01:01,592
the former chairman of Disney's film

18
