36
00:01:35,210 --> 00:01:36,002
Disney,

37
00:01:36,002 --> 00:01:37,341
NBCUniversal,

38
00:01:37,341 --> 00:01:38,133
Sony,

39
00:01:38,133 --> 00:01:39,472
WarnerMedia,

40
00:01:39,472 --> 00:01:40,264
Viacom,

41
00:01:40,264 --> 00:01:41,056
Lionsgate,

42
00:01:41,056 --> 00:01:41,575
MGM,

