00:01:41,575 --> 00:01:44,580
plus Alibaba and the banks Goldman Sachs

44
00:01:44,580 --> 00:01:46,000
and JPMorgan.

45
00:01:46,130 --> 00:01:47,402
And before launch,

46
00:01:47,402 --> 00:01:49,998
advertisers bought its entire first year

