00:01:53,087 --> 00:01:54,206
dollars.

50
00:01:54,450 --> 00:01:56,310
There was a warning sign.

51
00:01:56,310 --> 00:01:58,634
The same summer Quibi raised its first

52
00:01:58,634 --> 00:01:59,308
billion,

53
