60
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:16,674
Katzenberg insisted his service would be

61
00:02:16,674 --> 00:02:18,611
fundamentally different,

62
00:02:18,611 --> 00:02:20,352
built from the ground up for watching

63
00:02:20,352 --> 00:02:21,605
on a phone.

64
00:02:21,850 --> 00:02:23,970
Let me draw the bet.

65
00:02:24,170 --> 00:02:25,071
On one side,

66
00:02:25,071 --> 00:02:26,272
a huge number:

67
00:02:26,272 --> 00:02:28,581
billions of people with phones and a

68
00:02:28,581 --> 00:02:31,260
