79
00:02:48,717 --> 00:02:49,303
Then,

80
00:02:49,303 --> 00:02:50,814
just before launch,

81
00:02:50,814 --> 00:02:54,191
the whole world stopped commuting.

82
00:02:59,850 --> 00:03:02,127
What happens to an app for busy

83
00:03:02,127 --> 00:03:05,005
people when nobody is busy?

84
00:03:08,850 --> 00:03:10,842
Quibi launched on April sixth,

85
00:03:10,842 --> 00:03:11,939
twenty twenty,

86
00:03:11,939 --> 00:03:14,401
just as the pandemic was locking people

87
00:03:14,401 --> 00:03:16,120
