88
00:03:16,250 --> 00:03:18,671
It offered a free trial of ninety

89
00:03:18,671 --> 00:03:19,089
days,

90
00:03:19,089 --> 00:03:21,289
then cost four ninety-nine a month with

91
00:03:21,289 --> 00:03:24,090
ads or seven ninety-nine without.

92
00:03:24,270 --> 00:03:25,091
On launch day,

93
00:03:25,091 --> 00:03:27,619
according to the analytics firm Sensor

94
00:03:27,619 --> 00:03:28,230
Tower,

95
00:03:28,230 --> 00:03:30,336
it was downloaded about about three

96
00:03:30,336 --> 00:03:32,200
hundred thousand times.

97
00:03:32,220 --> 00:03:33,980
That sounds like a lot.

98
00:03:34,090 --> 00:03:36,438
But Disney's new streaming service had

99
00:03:36,438 --> 00:03:39,046
seen about four million installs at its

100
00:03:39,046 --> 00:03:40,168
own launch.

101
00:03:40,417 --> 00:03:42,617
The launch line-up was full of famous

102
00:03:42,617 --> 00:03:43,326
names,

103
00:03:43,326 --> 00:03:45,990
from Jennifer Lopez to Liam Hemsworth,

104
00:03:45,990 --> 00:03:48,678
with projects promised from directors like

105
