106
00:03:52,417 --> 00:03:54,981
Apple promoted the app across its store,

107
00:03:54,981 --> 00:03:56,921
and it climbed to number three on

108
00:03:56,921 --> 00:03:58,107
the App Store.

109
00:03:58,107 --> 00:03:59,126
For a few days,

110
00:03:59,126 --> 00:04:01,415
Quibi looked like the hit Hollywood had

111
00:04:01,415 --> 00:04:02,431
paid for.

112
00:04:02,684 --> 00:04:05,394
And Quibi had a bigger problem.

113
00:04:05,484 --> 00:04:07,734
It only worked on phones.

114
00:04:07,924 --> 00:04:10,098
People stuck at home wanted to watch

115
00:04:10,098 --> 00:04:12,754
on the big television in the living

116
00:04:12,754 --> 00:04:13,213
room,

117
00:04:13,213 --> 00:04:15,145
and at first Quibi could not be

118
00:04:15,145 --> 00:04:17,194
