119
00:04:17,684 --> 00:04:19,490
Its showpiece technology,

120
00:04:19,490 --> 00:04:20,839
called Turnstyle,

121
00:04:20,839 --> 00:04:22,668
let you rotate your phone and switch

122
00:04:22,668 --> 00:04:25,412
between a horizontal and a vertical

123
00:04:25,412 --> 00:04:27,324
version of the same scene.

124
00:04:27,324 --> 00:04:28,344
Clever.

125
00:04:28,674 --> 00:04:30,464
But it was built for a commuter

126
00:04:30,464 --> 00:04:32,456
who no longer existed.

127
00:04:32,717 --> 00:04:35,044
Even that clever feature came with a

128
00:04:35,044 --> 00:04:35,877
fight.

129
00:04:36,027 --> 00:04:36,904
Before launch,

130
00:04:36,904 --> 00:04:40,052
an interactive video company called Eko

131
