133
00:04:43,403 --> 00:04:46,027
patent and used its trade secrets.

134
00:04:46,147 --> 00:04:48,621
Quibi said the claims had absolutely no

135
00:04:48,621 --> 00:04:49,219
merit,

136
00:04:49,219 --> 00:04:50,868
and pointed out that it held its

137
00:04:50,868 --> 00:04:52,087
own patent.

138
00:04:52,177 --> 00:04:54,183
A legal battle was the last thing

139
00:04:54,183 --> 00:04:55,898
a new app needed.

140
00:04:56,150 --> 00:04:58,180
The downloads came.

141
00:04:58,180 --> 00:05:00,957
The question was whether anyone would

142
00:05:00,957 --> 00:05:01,866
stay.

143
00:05:07,517 --> 00:05:10,342
How many people actually paid?

144
00:05:16,517 --> 00:05:17,230
By May,

145
00:05:17,230 --> 00:05:20,178
CNN reported that Quibi had about about

146
00:05:20,178 --> 00:05:22,611
one point three million active users,

147
00:05:22,611 --> 00:05:24,331
most of them still on the free

148
00:05:24,331 --> 00:05:25,077
trial.

149
00:05:25,077 --> 00:05:27,006
Disney's service had more than fifty

150
00:05:27,006 --> 00:05:28,677
million customers.

151
00:05:28,707 --> 00:05:30,799
Netflix had a hundred and eighty-three

152
00:05:30,799 --> 00:05:31,817
million.

153
00:05:31,817 --> 00:05:32,725
Next to them,

154
00:05:32,725 --> 00:05:35,189
Quibi was a rounding error.

155
00:05:35,450 --> 00:05:37,540
Then the trials ended.

156
00:05:37,540 --> 00:05:40,441
Sensor Tower estimated that of about about

157
00:05:40,441 --> 00:05:42,512
nine hundred and ten thousand people who

158
00:05:42,512 --> 00:05:44,356
signed up in the first few days,

159
00:05:44,356 --> 00:05:47,050
only about about seventy-two thousand kept

160
00:05:47,050 --> 00:05:49,100
