173
00:06:12,949 --> 00:06:15,753
expecting a young audience glued to their

174
00:06:15,753 --> 00:06:16,914
phones.

175
00:06:17,024 --> 00:06:17,692
Instead,

176
00:06:17,692 --> 00:06:20,203
the audience was smaller than promised,

177
00:06:20,203 --> 00:06:22,944
and according to Broadcasting and Cable,

178
00:06:22,944 --> 00:06:24,556
the big brands that had bought one

179
00:06:24,556 --> 00:06:26,860
hundred and fifty million dollars of

180
00:06:26,860 --> 00:06:29,533
advertising were disappointed.

181
00:06:29,784 --> 00:06:32,047
Let me draw why a free trial

182
00:06:32,047 --> 00:06:34,264
can hide a problem.

183
00:06:34,404 --> 00:06:36,044
Imagine a funnel.

184
00:06:36,154 --> 00:06:37,088
At the top,

185
00:06:37,088 --> 00:06:39,024
everyone who downloads.

186
00:06:39,024 --> 00:06:40,139
In the middle,

187
00:06:40,139 --> 00:06:42,004
those who try a few shows.

188
00:06:42,004 --> 00:06:43,136
At the bottom,

189
00:06:43,136 --> 00:06:44,752
the few who pay when the free

190
00:06:44,752 --> 00:06:45,814
months end.

191
00:06:46,134 --> 00:06:48,312
A free trial makes the top look

192
00:06:48,312 --> 00:06:49,084
huge.

193
00:06:49,084 --> 00:06:51,344
But a business lives on the bottom.

194
00:06:51,394 --> 00:06:53,283
Quibi had a wide top and a

195
00:06:53,283 --> 00:06:55,299
very narrow bottom.

196
00:06:55,550 --> 00:06:57,087
And all this time,

197
00:06:57,087 --> 00:06:59,569
the money kept going out.

198
00:07:05,217 --> 00:07:08,242
Where did the money go?

199
00:07:14,217 --> 00:07:16,367
Mostly into shows.

200
00:07:16,457 --> 00:07:18,760
Quibi paid Hollywood prices for stars and

201
