246
00:08:41,982 --> 00:08:44,864
the founders made a decision.

247
00:08:50,517 --> 00:08:52,920
When do you stop?

248
00:08:59,517 --> 00:09:01,482
On October twenty-first,

249
00:09:01,482 --> 00:09:02,700
twenty twenty,

250
00:09:02,700 --> 00:09:05,787
Quibi announced it was shutting down.

251
00:09:06,107 --> 00:09:08,417
Katzenberg said its standalone business

252
00:09:08,417 --> 00:09:10,697
