262
00:09:30,084 --> 00:09:31,355
Keeping Quibi going,

263
00:09:31,355 --> 00:09:31,980
he said,

264
00:09:31,980 --> 00:09:34,304
would not have changed the outcome.

265
00:09:34,664 --> 00:09:36,566
It would only have spent a whole

266
00:09:36,566 --> 00:09:38,680
lot more money without any value to

267
00:09:38,680 --> 00:09:39,914
show for it.

268
00:09:40,204 --> 00:09:42,208
The founders said that in the weeks

269
00:09:42,208 --> 00:09:42,935
before,

270
00:09:42,935 --> 00:09:45,665
they had looked at every option,

271
00:09:45,665 --> 00:09:46,391
partners,

272
00:09:46,391 --> 00:09:48,244
buyers and new funding.

273
00:09:48,384 --> 00:09:50,437
Every one of those stones,

274
00:09:50,437 --> 00:09:51,106
they said,

275
00:09:51,106 --> 00:09:52,398
was turned.

276
00:09:52,650 --> 00:09:53,313
At first,

277
00:09:53,313 --> 00:09:55,828
Katzenberg had blamed the pandemic for

278
00:09:55,828 --> 00:09:57,800
almost everything.

279
00:09:58,160 --> 00:09:59,835
In their farewell letter,

280
00:09:59,835 --> 00:10:01,920
