283
00:10:04,680 --> 00:10:06,723
They had not.

284
00:10:06,984 --> 00:10:09,130
In January twenty twenty-one,

285
00:10:09,130 --> 00:10:11,782
the streaming company Roku bought Quibi's

286
00:10:11,782 --> 00:10:15,034
library of more than seventy-five shows.

287
00:10:15,084 --> 00:10:17,450
The price was reportedly significantly

288
00:10:17,450 --> 00:10:19,824
less than one hundred million dollars.

289
00:10:19,994 --> 00:10:22,265
A company that had spent around a

290
00:10:22,265 --> 00:10:24,308
billion dollars sold its shows for a

291
00:10:24,308 --> 00:10:26,043
